WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:05.020
Speaker 1: We, over the last few years, there's
been sort of a almost like a cultural battle

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:08.219
around the FBI and intelligence agencies.

00:00:08.219 --> 00:00:14.690
The FBI, much maligned by Donald Trump and
Trumpists for its allegedly politically biased

00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:18.290
involvement in electoral politics.

00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:22.880
Even though if you actually think back to
2016, the FBI's involvement may have been

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:24.970
what handed Donald Trump a victory.

00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:30.470
Remember James Comey's second completely unnecessary
press conference about the investigation into

00:00:30.470 --> 00:00:31.690
Hillary Clinton's emails?

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:33.620
But let's put that aside for now.

00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:41.470
Modern day we have seen the FBI become a flashpoint
of controversy, particularly in the context

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:43.030
of the Jan. six riots.

00:00:43.030 --> 00:00:48.540
There is now a blockbuster new investigation
from The Washington Post, which shows that

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:55.850
actually the FBI received very specific tips
about the violence that was expected to happen

00:00:55.850 --> 00:01:00.070
on January 6th, which did remember the day
of the Trump riots.

00:01:00.070 --> 00:01:04.970
But the FBI, as far as the Washington Post
has uncovered, declined to act.

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:07.250
This is stunning.

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:08.250
This is stunning.

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:09.650
Let's look at some of the information.

00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:14.280
A sprawling new investigation by The Washington
Post into the events leading up to the Capitol

00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:20.080
insurrection has revealed that the FBI received
numerous and highly detailed tips on the potential

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:24.729
for serious violence by followers of then-President
Donald Trump on January six.

00:01:24.729 --> 00:01:31.970
And despite the specificity and volume of
reports, the FBI largely dismissed the warnings.

00:01:31.970 --> 00:01:36.860
The fact that law enforcement of all stripes
reportedly underestimated the likelihood of

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:42.770
violence on January six has already been widely
reported, but the Post's massive project started

00:01:42.770 --> 00:01:43.900
last spring.

00:01:43.900 --> 00:01:50.030
Based on interviews of more than 230 people,
describes in excruciating detail just how

00:01:50.030 --> 00:01:52.220
much was ignored.

00:01:52.220 --> 00:01:57.020
In one of the more shocking revelations, the
Post recounts how information began flooding

00:01:57.020 --> 00:02:02.520
in to the FBI as early as December six, when
the agency received a tip about a message

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:08.750
in an online post telling Trump supporters,
Please be in D.C. armed on the six, you might

00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:10.869
have to kill the palace guards.

00:02:10.869 --> 00:02:12.020
Are you OK with that?

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:17.250
And indeed, there was violence against the
so-called palace guards U.S. Capitol Police

00:02:17.250 --> 00:02:19.520
there to defend the Capitol.

00:02:19.520 --> 00:02:23.569
Another message reported by the Post stated
in an apparent reference to killing officers

00:02:23.569 --> 00:02:25.050
drop a handful.

00:02:25.050 --> 00:02:30.610
The rest will flee, meaning kill a few US
Capitol Police, and then they're going to

00:02:30.610 --> 00:02:32.160
get out of our way.

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:38.150
On Dec. 19, Trump tweeted a message exhorting
his followers to come to DC on January six,

00:02:38.150 --> 00:02:41.400
writing quote big protest in D.C. on January
six.

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:43.709
There will be wild.

00:02:43.709 --> 00:02:45.030
That lit up online.

00:02:45.030 --> 00:02:49.420
Pro-Trump groups and FBI informants quickly
began passing on information about highly

00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:53.110
specific planning for a violent attack in
Washington.

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:55.200
Here's how the Post puts it.

00:02:55.200 --> 00:03:01.800
The FBI received a call alerting them to Trump
supporters, making plans online to bring arms

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:07.720
to Washington and arrest lawmakers that the
Sunday afternoon call was handled by the bureau's

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:13.920
National Threat Operation Center, a clearinghouse
for tips about crimes, according to a document

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:20.880
titled Threats to Take Guns and overrun the
D.C. police Jan. four to January 20th.

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:27.849
It's almost like the 911 memo bin Laden poised
to strike threats to take guns and overrun

00:03:27.849 --> 00:03:29.550
D.C. police.

00:03:29.550 --> 00:03:34.409
The file was updated the following afternoon
by an FBI employee seeking to reclassify the

00:03:34.409 --> 00:03:38.080
information more domestic terrorism than criminal
in nature.

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:42.410
They wanted to say, Hey, this is almost not
even just criminal.

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:44.569
This is domestic terrorism.

00:03:44.569 --> 00:03:48.190
Criminal has received a number of guardians
as a significant number of guardians as a

00:03:48.190 --> 00:03:51.760
result of threats to Congress and other government
officials.

00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:56.730
The caller, according to the FBI document,
said people were planning on meeting in certain

00:03:56.730 --> 00:04:02.350
areas and sneaking guns into D.C. in an attempt
to overrun the D.C. police.

00:04:02.350 --> 00:04:07.629
Beginning January 4th through 20th on three
different sites, there is discussion about

00:04:07.629 --> 00:04:13.280
recruitment, where to meet at, bring guns
and arresting senators and members of Congress

00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:19.439
to hold trials outside in public areas in
one specific threat.

00:04:19.439 --> 00:04:24.099
Utah Republican Senator Mitt Romney, often
regarded by Trump supporters as a traitor

00:04:24.099 --> 00:04:26.949
to MAGA, was named as a.

00:04:26.949 --> 00:04:36.039
Target, yet despite all of this, on December
22nd, the Post says the FBI closed its internal

00:04:36.039 --> 00:04:41.740
threat assessment of the matter, determining
it did not warrant further investigation at

00:04:41.740 --> 00:04:42.770
this time.

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:48.240
An FBI official told the Post that before
doing so, steps were taken to share the info,

00:04:48.240 --> 00:04:53.349
but ultimately the determination was made
that the tips they received featured vague

00:04:53.349 --> 00:04:58.979
and primarily First Amendment protected speech.

00:04:58.979 --> 00:05:06.529
When we think back and we say, how were they
not more ready and why was the National Guard

00:05:06.529 --> 00:05:09.009
not deployed in advance?

00:05:09.009 --> 00:05:14.830
And even as the capital was being overrun
and as we follow the chain of command upward,

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:21.039
we learned that on the day of it was Donald
Trump who was reportedly gleefully watching

00:05:21.039 --> 00:05:25.740
the first couple of hours of the riots, maybe
thinking it would actually prevent Joe Biden

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:29.249
from ultimately being certified as president
of the United States.

00:05:29.249 --> 00:05:31.680
Later, Trump started to not really like that.

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:35.740
The rioters looked low class and made him
look bad.

00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:40.300
But the pressure was building for him to deploy
the National Guard.

00:05:40.300 --> 00:05:42.759
He was told Mike Pence is potentially in danger.

00:05:42.759 --> 00:05:44.220
Mike Pence had to be evacuated.

00:05:44.220 --> 00:05:46.289
They were chanting, Hang Mike Pence.

00:05:46.289 --> 00:05:48.699
But we know that Trump was actually mad at
Mike Pence.

00:05:48.699 --> 00:05:54.629
Trump was furious that Pence wasn't willing
to do what Trump believed Pence could do to

00:05:54.629 --> 00:05:58.050
really stop the certification of Joe Biden
as president, even though Pence accurately

00:05:58.050 --> 00:06:01.349
told them, I can't do that, sir, I can't do
that.

00:06:01.349 --> 00:06:05.649
And the calls built for Trump to call off
the protesters and to send in the National

00:06:05.649 --> 00:06:06.649
Guard.

00:06:06.649 --> 00:06:10.159
And it was Trump who resisted doing that on
January 6th.

00:06:10.159 --> 00:06:15.860
But this is a much broader back story of a
sort of hot potato that was being played behind

00:06:15.860 --> 00:06:16.879
the scenes.

00:06:16.879 --> 00:06:22.879
The FBI was at the time that they could say
this is criminal, not domestic terrorism,

00:06:22.879 --> 00:06:27.869
sort of letting the D.C. police know you might
want to do something about this.

00:06:27.869 --> 00:06:33.149
The FBI was saying to Department of Justice,
You know, maybe you need to look into this

00:06:33.149 --> 00:06:37.710
and coordinate fencing or whatever the case
may be of Capitol Hill.

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:43.679
Police seemed not to actually even be told
what the FBI was aware of.

00:06:43.679 --> 00:06:47.349
And then there was this last minute request
for National Guard, which was initially resisted,

00:06:47.349 --> 00:06:50.949
although ultimately the National Guard was
deployed.

00:06:50.949 --> 00:06:55.689
And there are some people who are writing
this is just like what happened on 9-11, where

00:06:55.689 --> 00:06:58.319
agencies couldn't communicate, they couldn't
coordinate.

00:06:58.319 --> 00:07:03.469
There weren't systems in place, but this is
actually a clearly different thing after 911

00:07:03.469 --> 00:07:07.699
systems were put in place so that different
agencies could coordinate with each other.

00:07:07.699 --> 00:07:12.819
This seems more that there was a lack of willingness
to do those things for reasons we don't yet

00:07:12.819 --> 00:07:14.189
totally know.

00:07:14.189 --> 00:07:16.940
And possibly because somebody ordered them
to stand down.

00:07:16.940 --> 00:07:24.860
So let's I will now explain to you the more
benign explanation and then the really horrible

00:07:24.860 --> 00:07:34.439
one, the more benign explanation here is the
FBI genuinely didn't think that there was

00:07:34.439 --> 00:07:37.849
the potential for Jan. six to become what
it was.

00:07:37.849 --> 00:07:40.250
And they made a mistake in judgment.

00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:42.499
They didn't take it seriously enough.

00:07:42.499 --> 00:07:48.619
Now what's interesting about that is that
it would sort of run counter to the idea that

00:07:48.619 --> 00:07:55.309
the FBI and all of these intel agencies and
others were out there to make Trump look as

00:07:55.309 --> 00:07:57.639
bad as possible and all these different things.

00:07:57.639 --> 00:08:00.810
It sounds like, you know, if the FBI wanted
to make Trump really bad, they would have

00:08:00.810 --> 00:08:01.810
publicized this in advance.

00:08:01.810 --> 00:08:03.669
They would have made Trump look bad, etc.

00:08:03.669 --> 00:08:04.849
They didn't do that.

00:08:04.849 --> 00:08:09.919
The sort of sinister possibility for which
we don't yet have evidence right there.

00:08:09.919 --> 00:08:18.069
These are the speculative ideas is that someone
once they caught wind, that the FBI was receiving

00:08:18.069 --> 00:08:24.939
these threats, information about these threats
and starting to act on them, someone told

00:08:24.939 --> 00:08:25.939
the FBI.

00:08:25.939 --> 00:08:27.499
Stand down.

00:08:27.499 --> 00:08:31.370
Turn this over to someone else, sort of, but
don't really give a much information because

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:36.690
we want the riots to be able to happen because
we think maybe they actually will stop the

00:08:36.690 --> 00:08:38.849
certification of the election.

00:08:38.849 --> 00:08:43.020
We don't know the answer to that yet, but
every week we are getting more and more information

00:08:43.020 --> 00:08:50.290
about the fact that many people and by people,
we mean elected officials, associates of Trump

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:54.630
and law enforcement had reason to fear that
this was going to get really, really bad on

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:55.630
January six.

00:08:55.630 --> 00:09:00.959
And it did, and the right preparations were
not ultimately in place at some point.

00:09:00.959 --> 00:09:02.230
We may know the full story.

00:09:02.230 --> 00:09:03.490
We still don't know it as of right now.

